 "synopsis": "Promoter groups Bhaskar Srinivasan, BBS Family Trust, and KBS Family Trust are likely to sell up to a 6% stake in Avalon Technologies Ltd through a block deal valued at around ₹861.9 crore. The indicative price range for the transaction is set between ₹2,150 and ₹2,302 per share, featuring an offer discount of up to 6.6% to the market price and a 180-day lock-up period on further share sales by the sellers.",
